sequenceDiagram
  actor S as Student
  participant API as FastAPI API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Obj as S3
  participant Relay as Outbox relay
  participant Q as SQS
  participant W as Worker
  participant L as LLM adapter
  S->>API: POST submission metadata
  API->>DB: Insert CREATED submission
  API-->>S: 201 submission id
  S->>API: Request upload intent
  API-->>S: Short-lived scoped upload URL
  S->>Obj: Upload bytes (multipart for large files)
  S->>API: Complete upload with asset IDs
  API->>Obj: Verify key, size, checksum, scan state
  API->>DB: Persist assets; QUEUED job + outbox in transaction
  API-->>S: 202 evaluation id
  Relay->>DB: Claim unpublished outbox row
  Relay->>Q: Publish evaluation id (at least once)
  Q->>W: Deliver message
  W->>DB: Lease job / record attempt
  W->>Obj: Read immutable assets
  W->>L: Bounded evidence-based criterion requests
  L-->>W: Structured scores + evidence
  W->>DB: Validate, aggregate deterministically, persist result
  W-->>Q: Delete only after durable commit
  S->>API: GET evaluation/result
  API->>DB: Read authorized result
  API-->>S: Status/result
